    "Les charges sont arrondies à ton matériel (« %@ »). Aucune étude ne fixe un schéma unique : c’est une progression courante, à ajuster comme tu veux.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loads are rounded to your equipment (“%@”). No study sets a single scheme: this is a common progression, adjust it as you like."
          }
        }
      }
    },
